        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/angille/{size}/1917_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-19T21:39:06.676Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m agreeing with the others, but also pointing out that the Switch ability is really weirdly designed aside the various no-Boost modes. I almost want it to “degrade” to other action types if it’s not available, otherwise you burn a whole action just to switch modes.</p>",
